  "title": "Equipment sale computation",
  "html": "<div class=\"course-intro-card\"><h2>Equipment sale computation</h2><p>Calculate gain and recapture for a business equipment sale under the stated rules.</p></div><section class=\"quiz-card\"><h3>Required responses</h3><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m3-tbs3-f1\">Adjusted basis</label><input id=\"reg-m3-tbs3-f1\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m3-tbs3-f2\">Net amount realized</label><input id=\"reg-m3-tbs3-f2\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m3-tbs3-f3\">Recognized gain</label><input id=\"reg-m3-tbs3-f3\" type=\"text\"></div><div class=\"tbs-question\"><label for=\"reg-m3-tbs3-f4\">Ordinary Section 1245 recapture</label><input id=\"reg-m3-tbs3-f4\" type=\"text\"></div></section>",
